# Pix C (site assistant)

**Name:** Pix C (not Alice / Ada / Pix T). Spec: `docs/PIX-AGENT-BUILD.md`.

## Hard rules

- No LLM on the question path — `respond()` + this site’s `src/content/pix-kb.json` only.
- `MIN_COVERAGE = 0.7`; price / timeline / abuse / injection / off-topic beat retrieval.
- Fail closed on claims; never reuse Technologies’ KB or claims.
- Chat is React state only (no cookie / localStorage / sessionStorage).
- Secrets stay server-only (`pixContext()`, `lead-score`, enquiries).

## Layout

- Brain: `src/lib/pix/` · UI: `SiteAssistant` / `AssistantBoundary` / `PixSignal`
- Mount: root `layout.tsx` · Leads: `contact/actions.ts` → `enquiries.ts` (score server-side)
- Brand: petrol `#065456` / signal `#14A4A9` — not Technologies purple (`assistant.css`, `pixsignal.css`)
- Keep `.visually-hidden-heading` and `.honeypot` CSS or the dock leaks “Website” / ask labels

## Scripts

`pix:build` · `pix:check` · `check:pix-sources` · `pix:test` (also in `build` / `verify`)

